OL,3,GNEWSAWas this the 'world's wickedest
OL,4,Aman'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAleister Crowley, or the Great Beast
OL,7,F666 as he called himself, was a
OL,8,Fcontroversial figure in his day.
OL,10,FBorn in 1875, he was an occultist,
OL,11,Fpoet, writer, magician, painter, chess
OL,12,Fplayer and mountaineer.
OL,14,FCritics described him as a prolific
OL,15,Fdrug user, sexual deviant, Satanist and
OL,16,Ftraitor.
OL,18,FLess well known is that Crowley not
OL,19,Fonly had childhood connections to Kent
OL,20,Fand Surrey, but also spent his final
OL,21,Fyears in East Sussex.
